<!--
  V6.0 — Theme redesign uses downloadable Google Fonts for Inter. The
  Compose `GoogleFont.Provider` API authenticates with the Play Services
  font provider via these certificate hashes. They are published in
  countless official Android docs / samples and are the only thing the
  provider requires for font download authorization. Pulled from the
  JetNews Compose sample at https://github.com/android/compose-samples.

  If this file is missing or the hashes don't match the version on the
  device, Compose silently falls back to FontFamily.SansSerif via the
  `Font(googleFont, fontProvider, …, bestEffort = true)` overload — the
  app keeps working with the system font.
-->
